CuraEngine (AGPL-3.0), not in this repo
----------------------------------------
Slicing is done by CuraEngine 4.13.2, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
It is not part of this repository. container/Dockerfile downloads the official, unmodified
Cura LulzBot Edition 4.13.2 AppImage at build time (checked by sha256) and runs its CuraEngine
unchanged.
Source: https://gitlab.com/lulzbot3d/cura-le/cura-engine-le

3DBenchy
--------
test/golden/ is G-code of the 3DBenchy test model (the mesh name in the file). 3DBenchy is
CC0 / public domain since 2025.

